| HTTP Method | Route                              | Description                                       | Role Required | Request Body                           | Expected Response                                                                          |
| ----------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| GET         | `/api/events/{eventId}/categories` | Retrieves all categories belonging to an event.   | None          | None                                   | **200 OK** with category list; **404 Not Found** if event does not exist.                  |
| GET         | `/api/categories/{id}`             | Retrieves a specific category.                    | None          | None                                   | **200 OK**; **404 Not Found** if category does not exist.                                  |
| POST        | `/api/events/{eventId}/categories` | Creates an age or distance category for an event. | Organiser     | CategoryName, MinAge, MaxAge, Distance | **201 Created**; **400 Bad Request** for invalid data; **403 Forbidden** for Participants. |
| PUT         | `/api/categories/{id}`             | Updates an existing category.                     | Organiser     | CategoryName, MinAge, MaxAge, Distance | **200 OK**; **404 Not Found** if category does not exist.                                  |
| DELETE      | `/api/categories/{id}`             | Deletes an event category.                        | Organiser     | None                                   | **204 No Content**; **404 Not Found** if category does not exist.                          |
